// Least winning labeled hamming strictly above the smallest.
// No pair returns nothing. Equal hammings return nothing.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hnext ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hnext rank

IMPULSE hnext 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hnext" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
